---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import data from "../../scripts/games/fortune-text.json";
import "../../styles/fortune.css";
const sample = data.topics[0];
---

<Layout
  title="你的灵感签 · 普莱好运签"
  description="把启发留下，不把私密心事带出去。普莱好运签的本地预设解读。"
>
  <main class="fortune result">
    <div class="f-wrap">
      <header class="result-head">
        <span class="f-kicker">你的灵感签 / 本地内容演示</span><span
          data-result="context">白羊座 / 勇气与选择</span>
      </header><div class="result-grid">
        <section>
          <div class="sign-card">
            <header>
              <img
                src="/assets/games/fortune-wordmark.svg"
                alt="NewPlay"
              /><small>普莱好运签</small>
            </header><img
              class="sign-art"
              src="/assets/games/fortune-art.webp"
              alt="蓝色星环和金属流星艺术签"
            /><div class="sign-text">
              <small data-result="tag">白羊座灵感 / 向前一步</small><h2
                data-result="title"
              >
                {sample.title}
              </h2><p data-result="verse">{sample.verse}</p><small
                >星座灵感 × PLAI 解读</small>
            </div>
          </div><small class="center">把启发留下，不把私密心事带出去。</small
          ><div class="sign-actions">
            <button class="f-btn" id="save">收藏此签</button><button
              class="f-btn"
              id="download">下载 SVG 签卡</button>
          </div>
        </section>
        <article class="reading">
          <p class="f-kicker">签文</p><h1 data-result="title">
            {sample.title}
          </h1><p class="verse" data-result="verse">{sample.verse}</p><section>
            <h2>PLAI 的主题解读</h2><p data-result="interpretation">
              {sample.interpretation}
            </p><blockquote>
              <b data-result="perspective">白羊座的灵感视角</b><p
                data-result="view"
              >
                {data.views[0]}
              </p>
            </blockquote><small
              >这份解读按主题与星座视角匹配；相同选择会得到同一份本地内容，不暗示命定结果。</small>
          </section><section>
            <h2>把灵感落到今天</h2><ol id="tips">
              {
                sample.actions.map((a, i) => (
                  <li>
                    <>
                      <b>
                        {
                          [
                            "把第一步缩到十分钟",
                            "给试错留一个出口",
                            "留下真实的小证据",
                          ][i]
                        }
                      </b>
                      <p>{a}</p>
                    </>
                  </li>
                ))
              }
            </ol>
          </section><section>
            <h2>和 PLAI 再想一步</h2><p>选一个追问，看看本地延伸解读。</p><div
              class="follow"
            >
              <button class="f-btn" data-follow="0"
                >如果我还是不敢开始呢？</button
              ><button class="f-btn" data-follow="1">怎么判断是否继续？</button>
            </div><p id="follow-response" role="status"></p><small
              >预写内容演示，不是实时 AI 对话。</small>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div><footer class="result-foot">
        <div>
          <button id="share" class="f-btn pink">分享这份灵感</button><button
            id="summary"
            class="f-btn">复制解读摘要</button
          ><a href="/fortune/#draw">重新选择 / 再抽一签</a>
        </div><p id="result-status" role="status"></p><small
          >星座仅是创作灵感，不是科学预测，不保证运势或任何结果。解读用于娱乐与自我思考，不提供投资、医疗或法律指导。</small>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout><script src="../../scripts/games/fortune-result.ts"></script>
